<title>USA: Simon sees gain on property sale.</title>
<headline>Simon sees gain on property sale.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon Transportation Services Inc said Friday it had completed the sale of its former Salt Lake headquarters to the municipality of Murray City, Utah, and would recognize a $1.9 million pretax gain on the sale for its quarter ending June 30.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the $4.2 million cash proceeds to complete the construction of its new Salt Lake headquarters next month.</p>
